# WP-0001: Architecture Baseline

**Status:** SUPERSEDED
**Program Increment:** PI-001  
**Work Cycle:** WC-0001

## Objective

Establish the minimum accepted architecture baseline required to govern the first implementation work.

## Scope

### In Scope

- system context;
- system boundaries;
- major components;
- high-level information and control flows.

### Out of Scope

- detailed implementation design;
- optimization;
- post-MVP distributed architecture.

## Governing Artifacts

- Requirement: TBD
- Specification: TBD
- ADR: TBD

## Acceptance Criteria

- [ ] architecture overview is current;
- [ ] system context is explicit;
- [ ] system boundaries are explicit;
- [ ] required architecture diagrams are available;
- [ ] no unresolved contradiction exists with accepted architectural decisions.

## Validation

Architecture review against accepted governing artifacts.

## Completion Evidence

Record the implementing PR, architecture review, accepted decisions, and validation evidence here.

